# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fractional gates on IBM QPUs {#fractional-gates-on-ibm-qpus}"
msgstr "Fractional gates pada IBM QPUs {#fractional-gates-on-ibm-qpus}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Fractional gates are parameterized quantum gates that enable direct execution of arbitrary-angle rotations (within specific bounds),\n"
"eliminating the need to decompose them into multiple basis gates.\n"
"By leveraging the native interactions between physical qubits, you can implement certain unitaries more efficiently on hardware.\n"
msgstr ""
"Fractional gates ialah quantum gates berparameter yang membolehkan pelaksanaan terus putaran sudut sewenang-wenangnya (dalam had tertentu),\n"
"menghapuskan keperluan untuk menguraikannya kepada beberapa basis gates.\n"
"Dengan memanfaatkan interaksi asli antara qubit fizikal, kamu boleh melaksanakan beberapa unitari dengan lebih cekap pada perkakasan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM Quantum&reg; Heron QPUs support the following fractional gates:\n"
"- $R_{ZZ}(\\theta)$ for $0 < \\theta < \\pi / 2$\n"
"- $R_X(\\theta)$ for any real value $\\theta$\n"
msgstr ""
"IBM Quantum&reg; Heron QPU menyokong fractional gates berikut:\n"
"- $R_{ZZ}(\\theta)$ untuk $0 < \\theta < \\pi / 2$\n"
"- $R_X(\\theta)$ untuk sebarang nilai nyata $\\theta$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These gates can significantly reduce both the depth and duration of quantum circuits.\n"
"They are particularly advantageous in applications that rely heavily on $R_{ZZ}$ and $R_X$,\n"
"such as Hamiltonian simulation, the Quantum Approximate Optimization Algorithm (QAOA), and quantum kernel methods.\n"
"In this tutorial, we focus on the quantum kernel as a practical example.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gate-gate ini boleh mengurangkan dengan ketara kedalaman dan tempoh litar quantum.\n"
"Ia amat berguna dalam aplikasi yang banyak bergantung pada $R_{ZZ}$ dan $R_X$,\n"
"seperti simulasi Hamiltonian, Quantum Approximate Optimization Algorithm (QAOA), dan kaedah kernel quantum.\n"
"Dalam tutorial ini, kita fokus pada kernel quantum sebagai contoh praktikal.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Limitations {#limitations}"
msgstr "Had {#limitations}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Fractional gates are currently an experimental feature and come with a few constraints:\n"
"- $R_{ZZ}$ is limited to angles in the range $0 < \\theta < \\pi / 2$.\n"
"- Using fractional gates is not supported for [dynamic circuits](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow), [Pauli twirling](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#pauli-twirling), [probabilistic error cancellation](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#probabilistic-error-cancellation-pec) (PEC), and [zero-noise extrapolation](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#zero-noise-extrapolation-zne) (ZNE) (using [probabilistic error amplification](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#probabilistic-error-amplification-pea) (PEA)).\n"
msgstr ""
"Fractional gates kini merupakan ciri eksperimen dan ada beberapa kekangan:\n"
"- $R_{ZZ}$ dihadkan kepada sudut dalam julat $0 < \\theta < \\pi / 2$.\n"
"- Penggunaan fractional gates tidak disokong untuk [litar dinamik](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow), [Pauli twirling](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#pauli-twirling), [probabilistic error cancellation](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#probabilistic-error-cancellation-pec) (PEC), dan [zero-noise extrapolation](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#zero-noise-extrapolation-zne) (ZNE) (menggunakan [probabilistic error amplification](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#probabilistic-error-amplification-pea) (PEA)).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Fractional gates require a different workflow compared to the standard approach.\n"
"This tutorial explains how to work with fractional gates through a practical application.\n"
msgstr ""
"Fractional gates memerlukan aliran kerja yang berbeza berbanding pendekatan standard.\n"
"Tutorial ini menerangkan cara bekerja dengan fractional gates melalui aplikasi praktikal.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"See the following for more details on fractional gates.\n"
"- [Fractional gates](/guides/fractional-gates)\n"
"- [When *not* to use fractional gates](/guides/fractional-gates#when-not-to-use)\n"
msgstr ""
"Lihat yang berikut untuk maklumat lanjut tentang fractional gates.\n"
"- [Fractional gates](/guides/fractional-gates)\n"
"- [Bila *tidak* perlu guna fractional gates](/guides/fractional-gates#when-not-to-use)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Workflow approaches for the RZZ angle constraint {#workflow-approaches-for-the-rzz-angle-constraint}"
msgstr "Pendekatan aliran kerja untuk kekangan sudut RZZ {#workflow-approaches-for-the-rzz-angle-constraint}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The workflow for using fractional gates generally follows the [Qiskit patterns](/guides/intro-to-patterns) workflow.\n"
"The key difference is that all RZZ angles must satisfy the constraint $0 < \\theta \\leq \\pi/2$.\n"
"There are two approaches to ensure this condition is met, as we discuss below. We recommend the second approach, and in this tutorial, we demonstrate it through an example inspired by the quantum kernel method.\n"
"To better understand where quantum kernels are likely to be useful, we recommend reading [Liu, Arunachalam & Temme (2021)](https://www.nature.com/articles/s41567-021-01287-z).\n"
msgstr ""
"Aliran kerja untuk menggunakan fractional gates secara amnya mengikut aliran kerja [Qiskit patterns](/guides/intro-to-patterns).\n"
"Perbezaan utama ialah semua sudut RZZ mesti memenuhi kekangan $0 < \\theta \\leq \\pi/2$.\n"
"Terdapat dua pendekatan untuk memastikan syarat ini dipenuhi, seperti yang kita bincangkan di bawah. Kita mengesyorkan pendekatan kedua, dan dalam tutorial ini, kita menunjukkannya melalui contoh yang diilhamkan oleh kaedah kernel quantum.\n"
"Untuk lebih memahami di mana kernel quantum berkemungkinan berguna, kami mengesyorkan membaca [Liu, Arunachalam & Temme (2021)](https://www.nature.com/articles/s41567-021-01287-z).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also work through the [Quantum kernel training](/tutorials/quantum-kernel-training) tutorial and the [Quantum kernels](/learning/courses/quantum-machine-learning/quantum-kernel-methods) lesson in the Quantum machine learning course on IBM Quantum&reg; Learning.\n"
msgstr "Kamu juga boleh melalui tutorial [Quantum kernel training](/tutorials/quantum-kernel-training) dan pelajaran [Quantum kernels](/learning/courses/quantum-machine-learning/quantum-kernel-methods) dalam kursus Quantum machine learning di IBM Quantum&reg; Learning.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Generate parameter values that satisfy the RZZ angle constraint {#1-generate-parameter-values-that-satisfy-the-rzz-angle-constraint}"
msgstr "1. Jana nilai parameter yang memenuhi kekangan sudut RZZ {#1-generate-parameter-values-that-satisfy-the-rzz-angle-constraint}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you are confident that all RZZ angles fall within the valid range, you can follow the standard Qiskit patterns workflow.\n"
"In this case, you simply submit the parameter values as part of a PUB. The workflow proceeds as follows.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika anda yakin bahawa semua sudut RZZ berada dalam julat yang sah, anda boleh mengikuti aliran kerja Qiskit patterns standard.\n"
"Dalam kes ini, anda hanya perlu menghantar nilai parameter sebagai sebahagian daripada PUB. Aliran kerja berjalan seperti berikut.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you attempt to submit a PUB that includes an RZZ gate with an angle outside the valid range, you will encounter an error message such as:\n"
msgstr "Jika anda cuba menghantar PUB yang mengandungi RZZ gate dengan sudut di luar julat yang sah, anda akan mendapat mesej ralat seperti:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To avoid this error, use the second approach described below.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mengelak ralat ini, gunakan pendekatan kedua yang diterangkan di bawah.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Assign parameter values to circuits before transpilation {#2-assign-parameter-values-to-circuits-before-transpilation}"
msgstr "2. Tetapkan nilai parameter kepada litar sebelum transpilasi {#2-assign-parameter-values-to-circuits-before-transpilation}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `qiskit-ibm-runtime` package provides a specialized transpiler pass called [`FoldRzzAngle`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/transpiler-passes-fold-rzz-angle).\n"
"This pass transforms quantum circuits so that all RZZ angles comply with the RZZ angle constraint.\n"
"If you provide the backend to `generate_preset_pass_manager` or `transpile`, Qiskit automatically applies `FoldRzzAngle` to the quantum circuits.\n"
"This approach requires you to assign parameter values to quantum circuits before transpilation.\n"
"The workflow proceeds as follows.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pakej `qiskit-ibm-runtime` menyediakan pas Transpiler khusus yang dipanggil [`FoldRzzAngle`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/transpiler-passes-fold-rzz-angle).\n"
"Pas ini mengubah litar quantum supaya semua sudut RZZ mematuhi kekangan sudut RZZ.\n"
"Jika anda memberikan Backend kepada `generate_preset_pass_manager` atau `transpile`, Qiskit secara automatik akan menggunakan `FoldRzzAngle` pada litar quantum.\n"
"Ini memerlukan anda menetapkan nilai parameter kepada litar quantum sebelum transpilasi.\n"
"Aliran kerja berjalan seperti berikut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note that this workflow incurs a higher computational cost than the first approach, as it involves assigning parameter values to quantum circuits and storing the parameter-bound circuits locally.\n"
msgstr "Perhatikan bahawa aliran kerja ini menanggung kos pengiraan yang lebih tinggi daripada pendekatan pertama, kerana ia melibatkan penetapan nilai parameter kepada litar quantum dan menyimpan litar terikat-parameter secara setempat.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"caution\">\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Take note of a known issue in `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.47.0** where RZZ gates with invalid angles might remain in the circuits even after transpilation in certain scenarios.\n"
msgstr "**Ambil perhatian tentang isu yang diketahui dalam `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.47.0** di mana gate RZZ dengan sudut tidak sah mungkin kekal dalam litar walaupun selepas transpilasi dalam senario tertentu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"See [qiskit-ibm-runtime#2441](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/issues/2441) to track progress on this issue.\n"
"We recommend the following workaround until it is resolved.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lihat [qiskit-ibm-runtime#2441](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/issues/2441) untuk menjejaki kemajuan isu ini.\n"
"Kami mengesyorkan penyelesaian sementara berikut sehingga ia diselesaikan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    pm = generate_preset_pass_manager(backend=backend, ...)\n"
"    pm.post_optimization = PassManager(\n"
"        [\n"
"            FoldRzzAngle(),\n"
"            Optimize1qGatesDecomposition(target=backend.target),\n"
"            RemoveIdentityEquivalent(target=backend.target),\n"
"        ]\n"
"    )\n"
"    ... = pm.run(...)\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr ""

